{"version":1,"content":"<p>據台灣《工商時報》援引未具名供應鏈消息人士的報道，英偉達可能正在放緩對台積電的晶片下單節奏。該報道並未指明涉及的具體產品、製程節點、訂單規模或時間表，英偉達和台積電目前也均未對此作出回應。由於消息來源單一，相關説法仍應被視為傳聞。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585852.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:07:56.028050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:41:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:01:11.971828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:01:11.971828+00:00","content_hash":"8c9a0e99b89f12d98096653a9e4c62c32f6f24e61500a450c9681837b622375e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}